# EAS Build archives from the git repo root since mobile/ is nested inside
# the main BitLink repo, not its own standalone project. Without this, EAS
# was uploading the entire Next.js site (assets, PDFs, spreadsheets, docs)
# on every mobile build — slow, and it hit a transient failure trying to
# archive an unrelated file the mobile app doesn't even use. Scope the
# upload to only what the Expo build actually needs.
*
!mobile
!mobile/**
mobile/node_modules
mobile/.expo
mobile/dist
mobile/web-build
mobile/ios
mobile/android
